Cohen-Mansfield Agitation Inventory (CMAI)
The CMAI item names, behavior definitions, and rating scale anchors in
src/scoring/items.ts and src/scoring/engine.ts (and any text derived from them shown
in the app) are adapted from the Instruction Manual for the Cohen-Mansfield Agitation
Inventory, (c) 1991 Jiska Cohen-Mansfield; forms (c) 1986 Cohen-Mansfield, all rights
reserved. This material is NOT covered by the MIT License. The CMAI may be used free of
charge for non-commercial purposes; other uses require permission from the author
(Dementia Outcomes Measurement Suite, https://dementiaresearch.org.au/doms/behaviour).
Permission to adapt and display these definitions in this app: not yet requested
(tracked as register item P-01 in docs/review-register.md).

Citation: Cohen-Mansfield, J. (1991). Instruction Manual for the Cohen-Mansfield
Agitation Inventory (CMAI). Research Institute of the Hebrew Home of Greater Washington.

