The behavior icons in src/mockup/behavior-icons.tsx are shown only in Storybook, not in
the app. They come from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), ISC License, (c) Lucide
Contributors, and Tabler Icons (https://tabler.io/icons), MIT License, (c) Paweł Kuna.
Icons picked from Iconify (src/mockup/iconify-icons.tsx): Microsoft Fluent Emoji high
contrast (MIT, (c) Microsoft Corporation), Remix Icon (Apache 2.0, Remix Design),
Material Design Icons (Apache 2.0, Pictogrammers), Material Symbols (Apache 2.0, Google), Phosphor Icons (MIT), IconaMoon (CC BY 4.0, Dariush
